# DESK10 -- `Options -> Save desktop` on the SEEDED image (two directory
# windows open from cnx_get), so the written NEWDESK.INF carries real #W
# state. No drag: this run measures the FILE PATH (dos_create/dos_write/
# dos_close through the trap), not the window machine.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the injector.
# Hover the Options title (x 160..232) -> the box opens.
# "Save desktop..." is entry 11 of the Options box, 16 px per row below the
# 19 px bar: y = 19 + 11*16 = 195..211, centre 203.
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
2700 move 196 8
3100 mark C_OPTIONS_OPEN
3400 move 200 203
3600 down
3603 up
3900 parkbr
4300 mark D_SAVED
